:: Island Landing
You swim past many large bunches of coral and jagged chunks of rock before reaching a warm and sandy beach where you pull yourself out of the water.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Island]]>><<set $islanddistance to 0>><</link>>

:: Island Landing Boat
The ship stops a bit off shore. "I'm sorry this is the furthest we can take you. The rest of the way is full of rocks and corals that would wreck the ship's hull." You thank the men for the trip and dive into the water swimming to shore. You swim past many large bunches of coral and jagged chunks of rock before reaching a warm and sandy beach where you pull yourself out of the water.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Island]]>><<set $islanddistance to 0>><</link>>

:: Island
